[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1]
\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.7);
\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt);
\draw (145:1.7)--(35:1.7) node[midway,above,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] {$1$};
\draw (200:1.7)--(20:1.7) node[pos=0.22,below,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] {$2$};
\draw (0,0)--(280:1.7) node[midway,right,fill=white,inner sep=1pt] {$3$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
Which of the lines $1$, $2$ and $3$ is a diameter?

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1]
