\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt);
\draw (200:1.6)--(340:1.6);
\node[left] at (200:1.6) {$A$};
\node[right] at (340:1.6) {$B$};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
In the diagram, $AB$ is a chord.
Name the shaded region.
